"Sent to OpenAI per page. These placeholders are filled in automatically: "
"{{site_title}}, {{site_tagline}}, {{target_location}}, {{target_type}}, "
"{{country}}, {{city}}, {{area}}, {{nearby_locations}}."
msgstr ""
"Wordt per pagina naar OpenAI gestuurd. Deze plaatshouders worden automatisch "
"ingevuld: {{site_title}}, {{site_tagline}}, {{target_location}}, "
"{{target_type}}, {{country}}, {{city}}, {{area}}, {{nearby_locations}}."

msgid "Share a few words about your stay (optional)…"
msgstr "Deel een paar woorden over je verblijf (optioneel)…"

